            "published": "11 Sep 2025, 07:17",
            "summary": "Ear is an American electronic music duo, Yaelle Avtan and Jonah Paz.\nThey  met in 2024 while attending Bard College in Annandale-on-Hudson, New York. They bonded over shared musical interests including British post-punk, IDM, and the work of Mark Linkous of Sparklehorse. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/ear\">Read more on Last.fm</a>",
            "content": "Ear is an American electronic music duo, Yaelle Avtan and Jonah Paz.\nThey  met in 2024 while attending Bard College in Annandale-on-Hudson, New York. They bonded over shared musical interests including British post-punk, IDM, and the work of Mark Linkous of Sparklehorse. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/ear\">Read more on Last.fm</a>. User-contributed text is available under the Creative Commons By-SA License; additional terms may apply."
